== bash (homebrew 5.3) ==
ok - fm_dirname_to and fm_basename_to match dirname and basename on every edge case
ok - fm_epoch_seconds_to reads the clock like date +%s and forks date at most as often
ok - signal seen paths and absolute lock paths are byte-identical to the dirname/basename/tr forms
ok - recovery marker reads accept exactly the one-line records wc -l accepted
ok - window_to_task resolves every recorded window exactly as the grep/tail/cut pipeline did
ok - classify stat helpers resolve the kernel name once per process
rc=0
